exports[`US-NTF-11 · every email type uses the branded layout > passwordReset: matches its snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Reset your Spine password",
  "text": "Riverstone Builders

Reset your password

Hi Sam,
Someone asked to reset the password for this Spine account. Choose a new one with the button below.

Choose a new password: https://spine.example/reset-password?token=t

The link works once and expires in 1 hour. Choosing a new password signs you out on your other devices. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email — your password stays the same.

--
Riverstone Builders · 14 Harbour Road, Marina District",
}
`;

